  "description": "Retrospective planning permission for the following works at Rocks Lane Multi Sports Centre on Chiswick Common: Amending the hours of operation from 08:00 – 22:00 to 07:00 - 22:00 seven days a week, retention of a spectator area and ancillary social area adjacent to the central padel courts and retention of a wellness room in west of the site.\n",
